	/** Indicates the type of sale carried out. This is applicable only if you use [Chargebee's AvaTax for Communications](https://www.chargebee.com/docs/avatax-for-communication.html) integration. * retail - Transaction is a sale to an end user * vendor_use - Transaction is for an item that is subject… */
