/** Price ramp resource lets you define a stepped pricing schedule on an [item price](/docs/api/item_prices) in the Product Catalog. Each ramp is an ordered list of `ramp_intervals` that set the price for contiguous ranges of billing cycles, so new subscriptions inherit introductory or stepped… */
